sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS is connected with a stand-alone payment terminal
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: Test System has AuthCtrlr.AuthorizeRemoteStart = false
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: Test System has TariffCostCtrlr.Enabled[Cost] = false

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Present a payment card to the payment terminal Kiosk<br>for Charging Station with identity <Configured unique Charging Station identifier>

    CSMS->>CS: RequestStartTransactionRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId must be <evse><br>remoteStartId must be <not omitted><br>idToken.idToken <Not empty><br>idToken.type must be DirectPayment<br>idToken.additionalInfo.additionalIdToken must be <Configured CardLast4Digits><br>idToken.additionalInfo.type must be CardLast4Digits
    CS-->>CSMS: RequestStartTransactionResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Started,<br>idToken = <idToken from step 1>, idToken.type = DirectPayment,<br>idToken.additionalInfo = <additionalInfo>,<br>transactionInfo.transactionId = <transactionId>,<br>meterValue[0].timestamp = <not omitted>,<br>meterValue[0].sampledValue[0].value = 10000,<br>meterValue[0].sampledValue[0].context = Transaction.Begin)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: transactionLimit.maxCost <not omitted>

    Note over CS,CSMS: Settlement

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Ended,<br>idToken = <idToken from step 1>, idToken.type = DirectPayment,<br>transactionInfo.transactionId = <transactionId>,<br>transactionInfo.transactionLimit.maxCost = <not omitted>,<br>meterValue[0].timestamp = <not omitted>,<br>meterValue[0].sampledValue[0].value = 15000,<br>meterValue[0].sampledValue[0].context = Transaction.End)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: totalCost <not omitted>

    Note over CS,CSMS: Note: The CSMS sends a message to Payment Kiosk or PSP<br>to settle the cost for amount calculated for 5000 Wh
